WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.612
Begin with the actual P E endpoint and a credential reference authorized

00:00:04.612 --> 00:00:05.875
for the necessary reads.

00:00:06.288 --> 00:00:08.812
Add P C context when the assessment needs it.

00:00:09.225 --> 00:00:13.375
Establish persistent certificate trust in the appliance and preserve

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:15.912
the trust mount across container replacement.

00:00:16.288 --> 00:00:20.812
Verify that the certificate matches the endpoint name or address.

00:00:21.225 --> 00:00:25.175
Testing from your workstation alone does not prove connectivity from

00:00:25.175 --> 00:00:25.938
the Orchestrator.

00:00:27.142 --> 00:00:30.592
Open Upgrade Advisor and collect fresh inventory from the reviewed

00:00:30.592 --> 00:00:31.267
connections.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:35.542
Inspect discovered versions and fields that remain unknown.

00:00:35.892 --> 00:00:40.742
Enter the intended target versions and supporting evidence, then run

00:00:40.817 --> 00:00:41.617
the assessment.

00:00:41.992 --> 00:00:46.429
Review blockers, warnings, unknowns and readiness actions.

00:00:46.842 --> 00:00:49.892
Save an immutable assessment snapshot for the change record.

00:00:50.292 --> 00:00:55.054
This read-only advisor does not run an upgrade or replace vendor compatibility

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:56.479
and lifecycle checks.

00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:01.758
Save a desired configuration for D N S, N T P and

00:01:01.758 --> 00:01:04.683
Pulse with the correct cluster and credential reference.

00:01:05.071 --> 00:01:09.021
In Drift Detection select that file and Live Prism Element as the

00:01:09.021 --> 00:01:11.333
source, then run a manual check.

00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:15.308
Every live scheduled run collects fresh settings.

00:01:15.721 --> 00:01:18.296
Stored-snapshot comparisons are a separate mode.

00:01:18.696 --> 00:01:22.446
An unknown collection result must not be counted as a healthy match.

00:01:23.642 --> 00:01:28.292
Add or edit the Automation entry, choose the correct file, source

00:01:28.304 --> 00:01:32.129
and baseline, and review the five-field U T C cron expression.

00:01:32.529 --> 00:01:35.467
Save it enabled only after the manual check works.

00:01:35.879 --> 00:01:39.517
Inspect the next actual scheduled result and its timestamp.

00:01:39.917 --> 00:01:41.517
Pause schedules for maintenance.

00:01:41.904 --> 00:01:46.004
Editing or enabling an entry is not proof that a scheduled read

00:01:46.017 --> 00:01:47.529
has completed successfully.

00:01:48.712 --> 00:01:52.700
A certificate trust failure requires the approved issuing chain or

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.350
appropriate trust configuration.

00:01:54.738 --> 00:01:59.438
An I P or subject-alternative-name mismatch requires a matching endpoint

00:01:59.512 --> 00:02:00.212
or certificate.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:05.938
A network failure requires routing, firewall, name-resolution or target-service

00:02:05.938 --> 00:02:07.512
investigation from the appliance.

00:02:07.912 --> 00:02:11.825
These failures remain unknown, not drifted or matched.

00:02:12.225 --> 00:02:16.450
Do not disable verification or change the desired baseline just to

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.700
obtain a green result.

00:02:18.892 --> 00:02:24.067
Monitor and Verify links to Drift Detection, inventory and upgrade

00:02:24.079 --> 00:02:26.792
readiness, and Execution History and Logs.

00:02:27.192 --> 00:02:31.779
Correlate a job with the configuration, actual target reads and change

00:02:31.792 --> 00:02:32.192
record.

00:02:32.592 --> 00:02:37.217
N K P Validation Evidence remains under Advanced Automation with a

00:02:37.217 --> 00:02:39.942
Preview badge and its retained evidence sources.

00:02:40.342 --> 00:02:44.479
A specialist evidence pack or successful process is not an independent

00:02:44.479 --> 00:02:48.517
declaration that an A H V cluster is ready for workloads.
